{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2b0e07e7a42ffad530e62c7703f6972ee10d4289231a72ad4a8904e27536f8e0", "ja": "（今日の美奈子の仕事は、スポーツドリンクの\nキャンペーンガールだ。暑いし、ちょうどいいな！）", "zh": "（美奈子今天的工作，是担任运动饮料的Show Girl。\n天气这么热，这份工作来得正好！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "a056bb129fe48b88489e1042e9a6726c203e47b4745fa40ac1479fd56efe16dd", "ja": "こんにちは、新商品のスポーツドリンクの試飲です！\nよかったら飲んでくださいね♪", "zh": "大家好，这里可以试喝新出的运动饮料！\n有兴趣的话请来尝尝味道唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1002_staff", "source_sha256": "27215ce130cde1085f3158747f11a009a563e89ba95216e0c2101ad5994ee772", "ja": "お疲れさまです！\nそれでは、1時間の休憩に入りまーす！", "zh": "辛苦了！\n接下来是一个小时的休息时间～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1003_p", "source_sha256": "64e268e63c756452674d165da759fe3052c2b69ee29294d43663d0d8373848b7", "ja": "お疲れさま、美奈子！\n暑いからドリンクを飲んで、しっかり休憩しような。", "zh": "美奈子，辛苦了！\n天气很热，你就喝点饮料好好休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1004_019min", "source_sha256": "3964f595339ad4b7c213694662bc7f17a3f50285305d0ea199ffefd2b5330d3e", "ja": "お疲れさまです！　{$P$}さん、\nあの～、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "辛苦了！{$P$}先生，\n那个～可以占用你一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1005_p", "source_sha256": "cc8ba772e6b99bdffb4abc14c0e0d959893e418c7ff73c07f9576538206579b4", "ja": "いいけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "好呀，怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "08cfeea87876deb894fa31f88334c1fc8b02216236d5d1483586efdda2cc0dac", "ja": "はい！　今日、すっごく暑いので……差し入れに、\nカットしたフルーツを持って来たんです！", "zh": "嗯！因为今天很热……\n我带了切好的水果当慰劳品！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "f5f5553fa9fe9e10f255ff7ebe37f7658625e318ab4bb190ab7c263a7e8a9f8f", "ja": "スタッフさんに、クーラーボックスに入れてもらって\nましたから、よく冷えてますよ！　よかったらどうぞ！", "zh": "我有请工作人员帮我放进保冷箱，\n冰凉凉的喔！请你吃吃看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f6dded9bd5a1a8ddd74b62d4a5b65d72d40f641167fbcc9d1c5aadbf2045bb75", "ja": "おお、ありがとう！　それじゃ、いただこうかな。\n……うん、冷たくて甘い！　元気になりそうだ。", "zh": "哦哦，谢谢你！那我就不客气啰。\n……嗯，又冰又甜！感觉恢复活力了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "d58ab79ebcd7f2f6ef7c7ac31518cbed1349e3edf234b6788853c5da30be0a11", "ja": "ホントですか？　よかった！　それで、\nつい、たくさん持ってきちゃったんですけど……。", "zh": "真的吗？太好了！那个，\n我不小心带了很多过来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1010_p", "source_sha256": "89b48a7facc5409fa57f0bfc4ac5c32a3de9839ab169b1bd53c9f86558a3fc81", "ja": "ああ、スタッフの人達にも配ってきたらどうだ？\nきっとみんな喜んでくれると思うよ。", "zh": "这样啊，那你要不要也分给工作人员他们？\n我想大家会很高兴的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "7606d439003f28d28263eabd150737a8c98e9f86f268cdcec2ed1262bf73f128", "ja": "わっほーい！　ありがとうございます♪\nそれじゃ私、ちょっと行ってきますね！", "zh": "哇哦──！谢谢你♪\n那我去去就回！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "883d73a79c53f3feee22c49ac18022d311876d8ff5cd7191928120a4d2039b36", "ja": "{$P$}さん、今戻りました♪\nあの、今って、時間大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，我回来了♪\n那个，请问你现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1013_p", "source_sha256": "5d245b1ea9739eec54d3c4fa5a9b860eb1196a9f1b95c69d62eb6e051ef32718", "ja": "おかえり、美奈子。\n……うん？　そちらの方は……。", "zh": "美奈子，欢迎回来。\n……嗯？这位是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "7b86ae2deb8688ab8f671cd7920b7eebc601b910fb8a92cd6b7c13704bc5d3d8", "ja": "あっ、今回のお仕事の、メーカーの方みたいです！\n{$P$}さんと、お話がしたいって。", "zh": "啊，这位好像是这次厂商的代表！\n他说想跟{$P$}先生聊聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1015_innryoukaisyasyatyou", "source_sha256": "426dab6e29f29e19fa18c8a8ad4423eb3d6125d1fdb77a2139f7d04e1da74349", "ja": "キミが765プロのプロデューサーくんかね！\n初めまして、こういう者です。", "zh": "你就是765艺能的制作人啊！\n幸会幸会，这是我的名片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "886e3bff4c4a1e454defded6c1fc09e7cbc43b7c5271b563bb1832a21b9881a8", "ja": "えっ……あっ、このドリンクを作ってる\n飲料メーカーの、社長さんですか！？", "zh": "咦……啊，您就是生产这饮料的\n饮料公司的社长！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "3323a2bb75af69b7bf2b01380b16e71caafcb2988de0c1e5b2f087c863f2cf30", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうだったんですか！？", "zh": "咦咦！？是、是这样吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1018_innryoukaisyasyatyou", "source_sha256": "b699931407ebd4bf11b6ef45c5c3968a5e7e69799f6454746125b9df6daef2e7", "ja": "キャンペーンの様子が気になって、見学していてね。\n暑い中、すごく頑張ってくれている子がいて……。", "zh": "我很在意宣传活动的状况，所以就跑来参观了。\n看到天气这么热，还有这样勤奋的女孩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1019_innryoukaisyasyatyou", "source_sha256": "25895d05d4f9bf16419f6fd44bf84b2ce63e61a55aa82f9928b3483b9017fc52", "ja": "感じのいいお嬢さんだと思っていたら、休憩中、うちの\nスタッフ達にまで、差し入れをふるまってくれて……。", "zh": "我本来以为是哪户人家的小姐，没想到休息时\n还拿慰劳品给我的工作人员们……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1020_innryoukaisyasyatyou", "source_sha256": "66e182bd118e19f3cab03d1a9631cb79f4a0f04c66c6ef7b2163a478249c02d2", "ja": "おかげで、スタッフも元気が出たと言っていたよ。\n本当にありがとう！", "zh": "托你的福，工作人员们也说他们恢复活力了。\n真的很谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "a88531760ff63ebb5893f61fe7035bce1745882f318513a20db2459e5c03c2ad", "ja": "い、いえ、そんな！\n好きでやったことですから……。", "zh": "哪、哪里，不敢当！\n这是我自己自愿做的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1022_innryoukaisyasyatyou", "source_sha256": "bf7ee5a8718922ae5ec7ba88969fa3a946c5c122843e3971946b689a01ba3bd9", "ja": "それでだ。我が社が次に出す予定の、フルーツを使った\nドリンクのイメージに、キミがピッタリだと思ってね。", "zh": "言归正传，敝公司接着要推出一款添加水果的饮料，\n我觉得你恰巧符合那饮料的形象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1023_innryoukaisyasyatyou", "source_sha256": "10fb68d6f795409884d9ef4c2aad1fdfbbc4e98b48b2014ea8ad6ec0f6f314c2", "ja": "よかったら新商品のイメージガールとして、\nPVとCMに出演してくれないかね？", "zh": "如果愿意的话，能否请你当新商品的形象代言人，\n为我们拍摄PV和广告呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "45f1230eccb1041ac9e202c1d7489602e72b51f30aed6d7c668e656da557e731", "ja": "ええ～っ！？　わ、私がですか！？", "zh": "咦咦！？您、您说我吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1025_p", "source_sha256": "d33e92ace42797225b6ef3d1e8e0f58e7d4c4be986f3a83dd49ca39e5b35530f", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！\nやったな、美奈子！", "zh": "非、非常感谢您！\n美奈子，太好了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1026_019min", "source_sha256": "8f3f5e032f0d9173dfd074e6a1e4eaf71b29504ddbddad7c891faac0adf72356", "ja": "はい！　……けど、本当に私でいいんですか？", "zh": "嗯！\n……但您真的要找我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1027_innryoukaisyasyatyou", "source_sha256": "5d0064a040be141f5ad5960e0bf305a325dcd14ead2b4f43def39d980d44c2fa", "ja": "もちろん！　健康的で笑顔なところが、\nイメージにピッタリだよ。では、よろしく頼むよ！", "zh": "真的！你健康的笑容，就是我们想找的形象。\n那么，之后再麻烦你啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "f37e0799e1f97d057bdf45449c082bffb20e81ece25f316385d8748e7ba3f31f", "ja": "は、はい！　あの……私、がんばります！\nよろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "好、好的！那个……我会加油的！\n还请您多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "1dcdc4c982afb76c6480dc649489ea1e064f672e4960a967794a4aca7f41964d", "ja": "はぁ、ビックリした……{$P$}さん、\nこんなことってあるんですね……。", "zh": "呼，吓了我一跳……{$P$}先生，\n原来世上还真有这种事呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0094_1030_p", "source_sha256": "7ff5ad15c354307945738b8740b219e6498527eaaf1bc3bfc1764dadc4544bae", "ja": "（何気ない美奈子の気遣いが、こんな結果をもたらす\nとは……これもきっと、美奈子のアイドル力、だな！）", "zh": "（美奈子无心的体贴居然带来这样意外的成果……\n这肯定就是美奈子的偶像力吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
